{"suttaId":"tha-ap223","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[7791,7807],"vripara":"1"},"segments":{"tha-ap223:0.3":"Ālambaṇadāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap223:1.1":"“Atthadassissa bhagavato, lokajeṭṭhassa tādino;","tha-ap223:1.3":"Ālambaṇaṃ mayā dinnaṃ, dvipadindassa tādino.","tha-ap223:2.1":"“Dharaṇiṃ paṭipajjāmi, vipulaṃ sāgarapparaṃ;","tha-ap223:2.3":"Pāṇesu ca issariyaṃ, vattemi vasudhāya ca.","tha-ap223:3.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ, bhavā sabbe samūhatā;","tha-ap223:3.3":"Tisso vijjā anuppattā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap223:4.1":"“Ito dvesaṭṭhikappamhi, tayo āsiṃsu khattiyā;","tha-ap223:4.3":"Ekāpassitanāmā te, cakkavattī mahabbalā.","tha-ap223:5.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso, vimokkhāpi ca aṭṭhime;","tha-ap223:5.3":"Chaḷabhiññā sacchikatā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap223:6.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā ālambaṇadāyako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap223:7.1":"Ālambaṇadāyakattherassāpadānaṃ paṭhamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
